{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/id","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Events11EventRecordV2id20FoundationEssentials4UUIDVvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/EventRecord.swift#L23","fileName":"EventRecord.swift"},"modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"title":"id"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it had when first delivered."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4UUIDV"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It identifies the record, not a person: it is drawn for this record alone, never derived"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the device, the user, the session or another record, and two records never share one."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A collector that receives a record twice, as a redelivered record can be, keeps one copy by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord":{"title":"EventRecord","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracked event: the event itself, when it was tracked, where, and the context it was tracked in."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EventRecord"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"title":"Events","role":"collection","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventRecord/id":{"url":"\/documentation\/events\/eventrecord\/id","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"id","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The record’s identifier: a random (version 4) UUID drawn when the record is made. A tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws it when its worker accepts the tracked event, before the record is enriched, stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered; a store keeps it with the record, so a redelivered record has the identifier"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it had when first delivered."}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier"